        "filename": "Brooks Island from SS Red Oak Victory, 2014 04 13.jpg",
        "caption": "View of the main portion of en:Brooks Island, San Francisco Bay. To the right of the image can be seen the sandy spit that extends about 1 mile west of the main island. Beyond the spit is the small rock of Bird island. The cranes of the Port of Oakland can be seen in the distance. The photograph was taken looking southeast from the deck of the en:SS Red Oak Victory moored at Kaiser Shipyard No. 3, at Point Potrero in en:Richmond, California",
        "alt": "View of the main portion of en:Brooks Island, San Francisco Bay. To the right of the image can be seen the sandy spit that extends about 1 mile west of the main island. Beyond the spit is the small rock of Bird island. The cranes of the Port of Oakland can be seen in the distance. The photograph was taken looking southeast from the deck of the en:SS Red Oak Victory moored at Kaiser Shipyard No. 3, at Point Potrero in en:Richmond, California",
